When finished, record a 1-3 sentence outcome: apple-tasks update {id} --append-notes "<what you did>"
If you produced a PR, commit, or file: apple-tasks update {id} --url "<link>"
then apple-tasks complete {id}
and apple-tasks update {id} --remove-tag {claimTag}
